# NOTE: the uncompiled sources and the files needed to rebuild them ship with
# the plugin on purpose, so the compiled assets in assets/build/ can be
# regenerated and audited. Do not exclude any of the following:
#   dev_gameengine/          React source for the admin app and the frontend
#   assets/scss/             Sass source for the compiled stylesheets
#   package.json             npm dependencies and build scripts
#   package-lock.json        exact dependency tree for a reproducible build
#   webpack.config.js        bundler configuration
#   tailwind.config.js       Tailwind configuration
#   postcss.config.cjs       PostCSS configuration
#   jsconfig.json            path aliases used by the bundler config
#   composer.json            PHP dependency manifest
#   composer.lock            exact PHP dependency versions
